keys-Apple-M5U-TF-Full-GLM5.3-MLX-4bit
Modified copy of TensorFold (https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold) at upstream
commit d30325dcb5422d3981ab6de6633e2ae0af6ad17e (version 1.3.4).

Changes made by this repository's author (drowzeys), 2026, are listed in
MODIFICATIONS.md. In short: a new model family `glm_ax` (full GLM-5.3 on MLX
4-bit weights, Metal), its registration in four upstream files, one dispatch-size
fix in the GLM DSA indexer, upstream's README moved to README-TensorFold.md,
benchmark scripts and an MTP-head merge script under glm53/. The glm_ax Metal kernels were derived from TensorFold's own GLM-5.3-Flash
kernels (glm_sparse_nax, glm_index_nax and their split/combine decode path) and
build on TensorFold's core row-projection, affine matmul and MoE routing code.
These changes are released under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

